    "Built-in formats work without them. LibreOffice adds Word, Excel and PowerPoint to PDF with their layout. FFmpeg adds MP3, FLAC, WebM, WebP and GIF. Only copies you installed are used; nothing is downloaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built-in formats work without them. LibreOffice adds Word, Excel and PowerPoint to PDF with their layout. FFmpeg adds MP3, FLAC, WebM, WebP and GIF. Only copies you installed are used; nothing is downloaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置格式不需要它们。LibreOffice 可把 Word、Excel 和 PowerPoint 转成保留版式的 PDF；FFmpeg 增加 MP3、FLAC、WebM、WebP 和 GIF。只使用你自己安装的版本，不会下载任何东西。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內建格式不需要它們。LibreOffice 可把 Word、Excel 和 PowerPoint 轉成保留版面的 PDF；FFmpeg 增加 MP3、FLAC、WebM、WebP 和 GIF。只使用你自行安裝的版本，不會下載任何東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
