    "Shelf works with text, links and files you choose. macOS may ask for access to a protected folder when you use a file from it. Full Disk Access is not required.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shelf works with text, links and files you choose. macOS may ask for access to a protected folder when you use a file from it. Full Disk Access is not required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shelf 可保存文字、链接和你选择的文件。使用受保护文件夹中的文件时，macOS 可能请求该文件夹的访问权限，无需完整磁盘访问。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
