    "Full Disk Access is optional. YC Island uses it to read custom Focus names, icons and colors. Shelf and basic Focus detection work without it. To enable it, add the app shown in Finder in System Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full Disk Access is optional. YC Island uses it to read custom Focus names, icons and colors. Shelf and basic Focus detection work without it. To enable it, add the app shown in Finder in System Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整磁盘访问是可选权限，YC Island 仅用它读取自定义专注模式的名称、图标和颜色。Shelf 和基本专注模式检测无需此权限。如需开启，请在系统设置中加入 Finder 显示的 App。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整磁碟存取權是選用權限，YC Island 僅用它讀取自訂專注模式的名稱、圖示和顏色。Shelf 和基本專注模式偵測無需此權限。如需開啟，請在系統設定中加入 Finder 顯示的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
