    "Atoll can show all your upcoming events in one place. Access to your calendar is needed to display your schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll은 예정된 모든 일정을 한곳에 모아 보여줍니다. 일정을 표시하려면 캘린더 접근 권한이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll kan al je aankomende activiteiten op één plek weergeven. Toegang tot je agenda is nodig om je planning te tonen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Atoll pode mostrar todos os seus próximos eventos em um só lugar. O acesso ao seu calendário é necessário para exibir sua agenda."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для отображения расписания нужен доступ к календарю."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll สามารถแสดงกิจกรรมที่กำลังจะมาถึงทั้งหมดในที่เดียว ต้องการสิทธิ์เข้าถึงปฏิทินเพื่อแสดงตารางของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll, yaklaşan tüm etkinliklerinizi tek bir yerde gösterebilir. Programınızı görüntülemek için takviminize erişim gerekir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll 可以在一处显示您所有即将到来的事件。需要访问您的日历才能显示您的日程。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll 可以在一處顯示你所有即將到來的事件。需要存取你的行事曆才能顯示你的日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Atoll includes a mirror feature that lets you quickly check your appearance using your camera, right from the notch. Camera access is required only to show this live preview. You can turn the mirror feature on or off at any time in the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll에는 노치에서 바로 카메라를 통해 외모를 빠르게 확인할 수 있는 거울 기능이 포함되어 있습니다. 카메라 접근 권한은 이 실시간 미리보기를 표시하는 용도로만 사용됩니다. 거울 기능은 앱 설정에서 언제든지 켜거나 끌 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll bevat een spiegelfunctie waarmee je via de camera snel je uiterlijk kunt bekijken, rechtstreeks vanuit de inkeping. Cameratoegang is alleen nodig voor deze livevoorvertoning. Je kunt de spiegelfunctie op elk moment in de app in- of uitschakelen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Atoll possui um recurso de espelho que permite verificar rapidamente sua aparência usando sua câmera, direto do notch. O acesso à câmera é necessário apenas para mostrar esta visualização ao vivo. Você pode ligar ou desligar o recurso de espelho a qualquer momento no aplicativo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Разрешение к камере нужно для включения функции зеркала в вырезе."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll มีฟีเจอร์กระจกเงาที่ให้คุณตรวจสอบลักษณะของคุณโดยใช้กล้อง จากรอยบากได้ทันที สิทธิ์เข้าถึงกล้องต้องใช้เฉพาะเพื่อแสดงตัวอย่างสดนี้ คุณสามารถเปิดหรือปิดฟีเจอร์กระจกเงาได้ทุกเมื่อในแอป"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll, kameranızı kullanarak görünümünüzü doğrudan çentikten hızlıca kontrol etmenizi sağlayan bir ayna özelliği içerir. Kamera erişimi yalnızca bu canlı önizlemeyi göstermek için gereklidir. Ayna özelliğini uygulamada istediğiniz zaman açıp kapatabilirsiniz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll 包含镜像功能，让您可以直接从刘海处使用相机快速检查外观。相机访问仅用于显示实时预览。您可以随时在应用中开启或关闭镜像功能。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Atoll 包含鏡像功能，讓你可以直接從瀏海處使用相機快速檢查外觀。相機存取僅用於顯示即時預覽。你可以隨時在 App 中開啟或關閉鏡像功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
