    "Memory pressure is critical; the system may purge aggressively." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "메모리 압력이 심각함. 시스템이 메모리를 강제로 정리할 수 있음."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De geheugendruk is kritiek; het systeem kan geheugen agressief vrijmaken."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нагрузка на память критическая; система может начать агрессивную очистку."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แรงกดหน่วยความจำวิกฤต ระบบอาจล้างอย่างรุนแรง"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bellek baskısı kritik öneme sahiptir; sistem agresif bir şekilde temizlenebilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内存压力严重；系统可能会激进地清理内存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記憶體壓力嚴重；系統可能會激進地清理記憶體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory pressure is elevated. Closing apps may help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
